  "description_short": "Artisan coffee shop and deli in Sedgefield serving quality roasts, homemade treats, and wholesome market-style fare.",
  "description_long": "Flat Lizard & Co brings a warm, community feel to Sedgefield's coffee scene. Tucked into the Houtappel Building, this cosy spot draws locals and visitors for expertly pulled espresso, fresh pastries, and a thoughtful selection of deli items. The atmosphere is relaxed and welcoming, with a focus on quality ingredients and honest flavours.\n\nTheir coffee is roasted with care, and the menu includes homemade baked goods, hearty sandwiches, and wholesome breakfast options. The deli counter stocks local produce, artisan products, and pantry staples, making it a handy stop for provisions or a quick bite. It's the kind of place where you'll find locals catching up over a flat white and visitors stocking up for their Garden Route adventures.\n\nWhether you're after a morning caffeine fix, a leisurely brunch, or provisions for the road, Flat Lizard & Co offers a genuine, unpretentious experience in the heart of Sedgefield.",
